  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>CVG_BindingFormationCore</defName>
    <label>binding formation core</label>
    <description>Core of the Formation of Binding. Every ten seconds it immobilizes the strongest enemy inside the area for 5 seconds per level (a cultivator of higher realm first). Each binding uses half a spirit stone. The Binding Formation comes from the chains the Sect of Nine Temperings used to hold a mad demon-cultivator for three hundred years, until its elders learned to forge the chains out of qi alone. It only holds one prisoner at a time, but it chooses the most dangerous.</description>
