  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>CVG_ProtectiveFormationCore</defName>
    <label>grand protective formation core</label>
    <description>Core of the Grand Protective Formation. A dome over the area enclosed by at least four flags that absorbs every enemy projectile that enters it. Each hit costs spirit stones in proportion to its damage (120 damage per stone per level) and it burns half a stone a day just by being up. If it runs dry, the dome falls. In the Calamity of Iron the Heavenly Cauldron Pavilion bought the lives of its alchemists with a single dome of qi, paid for with spirit stones until the vaults ran dry. Since then every sect measures its wealth by how long its Grand Protective Formation could last.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Building/CVG/Formations/ProtectiveFormationCore</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawRotated>false</drawRotated>
